   <p><note place="header">446</note></p>
<p><date when="1865-03-15">March 15<hi rend="sup">th</hi> <gap/>5</date>
<lb/><unclear>Ben</unclear> <unclear>Hannigan</unclear>
<lb/><unclear/> <placeName ref="cwgk:P001800">Ky
</placeName><lb/>Sir</p>
<p>Yours of <date when="1865-02-20">Feby 20<hi rend="sup">th</hi></date> to the <persName ref="cwgk:N001000">Governor</persName> has been referred to me for answer.</p>
<p>It is not deemed advisable at present to increase the number of <orgName ref="cwgk:O00000303">State troops</orgName> Already in the field. If it is determined to raise more, your claim will be duly considered</p>
<p>Very Respectfully
<lb/><persName ref="cwgk:N00000873">D W Lindsey</persName>
<lb/>Adjutant Gen of <orgName ref="cwgk:O001025">Ky</orgName></p>
  </body>
